{"pdfData":[[{"bbox":[9,29,75,56],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99999,"text":"第28卷第7期 2007年 7月 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"b0452316-08ca-49cc-b214-6d0f25af7fc1","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-0"},{"bbox":[124,29,354,57],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99998,"text":"东 北 大 学 学 报 （ 自 然 科 学 版 ） Journal of Northeastern U niversity（Natural Science） ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"90bf9bd7-3098-4727-8615-01dd1d160eb0","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-1"},{"bbox":[409,29,471,56],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99997,"text":"Vol.28,No.7 Jul: 20 0 7 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"a565b000-b30a-4130-8df1-ab8adb757d87","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-2"},{"bbox":[82,98,398,148],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":3,"level":1,"text":"# 各向异性岩体破坏过程声发射测量 及其定位实验研究","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"b0661127-5b24-46ce-be44-6d23a5aaaf2b","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-3"},{"bbox":[118,164,359,204],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"王述红1 张亚兵1 张 楠1 李正仁2 东北大学 资源与土木工程学院 辽宁 沈阳 2．首尔国立大学 土木城市岩土系统工程学院韩国 首尔 151742） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"331fc969-5984-42da-b245-5447f22946bc","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-4"},{"bbox":[27,221,451,291],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"摘 要，应用改进后的声发射设备，实验测量了花岗岩试样在单轴压缩加载条件下变形破坏过程中声发 射现象 讨论分析了该试样损伤破坏过程中的诱发微裂纹相互作用 积累等 同时采用对速度结构依赖较少的 相对定位方法 对非均质岩石试验中的声发射事件进行了定位研究 结果表明 相对定位方法可用于复杂试样 和工程岩体的声发射事件定位 其可靠性及精度比以往有所提高 能够初步定量分析岩石在外载荷作用下的 破坏过程的定位问题 对于工程岩体破坏问题分析具有很好的借鉴意义 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"ee14fde9-9bd1-4047-a914-7af5bcd2618b","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-5"},{"bbox":[28,293,240,304],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"关 键 词：声发射；实验；岩石；各向异性；定位测试 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"2f2621e9-3050-4629-91e9-6fadaa15d95a","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-6"},{"bbox":[28,306,119,319],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"中图分类号：P 631．3 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"2882f37b-4036-4f72-b5da-ff265e52558b","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-7"},{"bbox":[141,307,206,319],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"文献标识码：A ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"f3276a9d-78ea-4368-91a7-491487dd9358","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-8"},{"bbox":[228,306,385,319],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"文章编号：1005-3026（2007）07-1033-04 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"5035d097-a583-421f-b415-cbea60a7ab64","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-9"},{"bbox":[27,340,451,375],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":10,"level":1,"text":"# Experimental Study on Acoustic Emission Measurement and Source Location for Anisotropic Rock Failure Process","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"ea763ad6-cb60-421f-847d-ddeb17a704ad","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-10"},{"bbox":[29,381,356,395],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"merge_prev":false,"text":"WA NG Shu-hong1ZHA NG Y a-bing1ZHA NG Nan1LEE Chung-in2 （1．School of Resources ＆ Civil EngineeringNortheastern U niversityShenyang 110004China；2．College of 9 CivilUrban and Geosystem EngineeringSeoul National U niversitySeoul 151742 Korea．Correspondent： WANG Shu-hongE-mail：shwang ＠ mail．neu．edu．cn） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"f8aa658d-0e7f-4693-91a5-1390bd0f2699","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-11"},{"bbox":[28,394,451,431],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"f8aa658d-0e7f-4693-91a5-1390bd0f2699","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-12"},{"bbox":[27,437,451,564],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":13,"merge_prev":false,"text":"<sup>Abstract：</sup> With an improved experimental setup for AE（acoustic emission）the AE measurement was carried out for the specimens of anisotropic granite in the deformations／failure process under uniaxial compression．Discusses the initiation of microcracks thus induced and their interaction and propagation during damage／failure．A relative source locating method was introduced into the study on the AE occurrences in anisotropic and heterogeneous rock specimensw hich is less dependent on sounding wave velocity．T he results showed that the method is available to AE occurrences in complex specimens and engineering rock mass with higher reliability and accuracy than before．And it can offer preliminarily a quantitative analysis of locating the source of rock failure process under the action of external loadingthus benefiting the analyses of other failures of engineering rock mass ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"b544a822-95b0-42c5-9b6b-ea3d8a7675a5","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-13"},{"bbox":[28,564,393,577],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"merge_prev":false,"text":"<sup>Key words：</sup> AE（acoustic emission）；experiment；rock；anisotropy；source location ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"372653d5-585f-46aa-b849-4b9bf07780dc","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-14"},{"bbox":[6,594,231,703],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"merge_prev":false,"text":"声发射技术是研究岩石 岩体 变形破坏微观 机理的重要手段 对研究岩石失稳的机制和前兆 具有重要科学和工程意义 而其定位技术是开展 声发射研究的关键和难点所在 岩石作为一种复 杂的自然地质体 在外界载荷和外界环境的作用 下，其中的各种缺陷长大合并，形成裂纹，直到发 生宏观破坏 岩石这种内部产生的微破裂诱发的 弹性波发射 即为岩石的声发射 工程中 脆性岩 石的破坏过程本质上是岩石缺陷 微裂缝 节理 断层等 损伤演化到大面积破坏的过程 其产生的 机制与实验室岩石加载产生声发射的机制有很多 相同之处 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"797bcbfe-0933-4c46-8589-22fa28ea5b13","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-15"},{"bbox":[247,594,472,671],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":16,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"797bcbfe-0933-4c46-8589-22fa28ea5b13","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-16"},{"bbox":[247,672,472,703],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":17,"merge_prev":false,"text":"关于声发射技术 国内外已经进行了不少实 验和数值方面的研究<sup>［1－6］</sup> Mogi 对不同材料的 声发射作了实验研究之后认为这些不同的声发 射模式与岩石的均质度有关 1933年沃尔科夫 就曾经指出 构成物体的材料 从总体上看是可 能均质的 但是从微观上看 却是十分不均一 的 这些非均质的破坏 只能利用统计的办法来 研究 唐春安及其课题组成员通过引入均质度来 描述岩石的细观特征 并用物理和数值方法研究 了岩石的非均质对其破坏的影响 取得了一些研 <sub>究进展</sub>［4－8］ <sub>另一方面 目前有关岩石破坏的数</sub> 值计算方法 由于处理岩石破坏问题的复杂性 除 了对破坏前的应力状态进行分析外 很难对整个 破坏过程中的声发射时间序列和空间分布规律进 行分析 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"35a05bfa-f829-4c80-9b30-0435b0b981f8","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-17"},{"bbox":[22,723,104,735],"type":"page_footnote","angle":0,"index":1000017,"text":"收稿日期：2006-08-22 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"6ee4f782-8ec4-44f6-a067-0e95692ad2fd","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-18"},{"bbox":[20,735,472,757],"type":"page_footnote","angle":0,"index":1000018,"text":"基金项目：国家自然科学基金资助项目（50490274；50674025；50504005）；中韩青年科学家交流项目（KOSEF－2004）；国家留学基 金资助项目 辽宁省博士启动基金资助项目 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"714869a6-75cb-4cf8-aa07-e2be4983154d","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-19"},{"bbox":[18,755,495,771],"type":"page_footnote","angle":0,"index":1000019,"text":"作者简介：王述红（1969－）男江苏泰州人东北大学副教授博士· ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"b4051582-41ef-4ef8-8052-77923b1f5378","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"0-20"}],[{"bbox":[177,18,303,31],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99998,"text":"东北大学学报（自然科学版） ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"8b48b907-23fc-4501-9c6d-95957ff83c6c","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-0"},{"bbox":[423,18,462,31],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99997,"text":"第28卷 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"f927f2c2-dbc1-46be-827b-8df95c4f8dbb","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-1"},{"bbox":[6,46,232,250],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"35a05bfa-f829-4c80-9b30-0435b0b981f8","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-2"},{"bbox":[6,252,232,362],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本文应用改进后的声发射设备 首先在实验 室应用对速度结构依赖较少的相对定位方法 给 出了定位测试的数学原理 对非均质岩石试验中 的声发射事件进行了定位实验研究 实验测量了 花岗岩试样在压缩加载条件下变形破坏过程中声 发射现象 分析了该试样损伤破坏过程中的诱发 微裂纹相互作用 积累等 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"1d0dd0be-5a39-41b5-80b2-4fae894afc46","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-3"},{"bbox":[7,370,130,386],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"level":2,"text":"## 1 声发射定位方法","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"5f8950fb-6e95-4e9c-9961-54a6a34e9765","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-4"},{"bbox":[6,395,231,473],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"岩石声发射定位方式通常包括区域定位 衰 减定位 时差定位 包括相关法时差 定位的准确 性是衡量一个声发射仪器软硬件性能的一项综合 指标 仪器能根据所接收到的波形进行智能分析 定位 本次实验主要考虑区域定位 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"1cfbff11-1c53-4f85-8567-bfbe8da063ca","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-5"},{"bbox":[6,475,232,537],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"通常声发射位置的确定主要依靠传感器在试 件表面的位置 利用不同位置的传感器在同一时 间测定某一位置的声发射信号 利用该信号到达 各个传感器的时间差来确定 具体计算方法如下 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"5e3ebdd9-4af8-43cd-9a1e-ea162bfd4f28","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-6"},{"bbox":[7,538,232,647],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"如图 所示 在各向同性介质中建立适当坐 标 三维情况下考虑一组传感器 个 传感器位 置的坐标已知： $A \\ b _ { 1 } \\left( \\ b _ { x } \\ b _ { 1 } \\ y _ { 1 } \\ z _ { 1 } \\right) , \\ b _ { A \\ b _ { 2 } } \\left( \\ b _ { x } \\ b _ { 2 } \\ y _ { 2 } \\ z _ { 2 } \\right)$ A $(  { x 3 y 3 z 3 } ) , A _ { 4 } \\big (  { x 4 y 4 z 4 } \\big )$ 并假设 K 点为岩石内 部任意声发射发生位置 $K ( \\boldsymbol { x } , \\boldsymbol { y } , z )$ 声发射信号 （ ）从 K 点到达每个传感器的时间可以测量 即对于 KA ： ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"a87a2257-c787-41e9-a27b-0d59ac41b02b","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-7"},{"bbox":[5,651,234,690],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":9,"text":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} V _ {\\mathrm{P}} \\Delta_ {1 2} = \\sqrt {(x - x _ {1}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {1}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {1}) ^ {2}} - \\\\ \\sqrt {(x - x _ {2}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {2}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {2}) ^ {2}}; \\end{array} \\tag {1}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"fef49fc2-1b35-4ebb-8bfc-61657b7188d2","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-8"},{"bbox":[5,709,234,748],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":10,"text":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} V _ {\\mathrm{P}} \\Delta_ {2 3} = \\sqrt {(x - x _ {2}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {2}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {2}) ^ {2}} - \\\\ \\sqrt {(x - x _ {3}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {3}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {3}) ^ {2}}; \\end{array} \\tag {2}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"73ed969c-6fea-4329-884c-966f48f50019","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-9"},{"bbox":[246,47,475,101],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":11,"text":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} V _ {\\mathrm{P}} \\Delta_ {3 4} = \\sqrt {(x - x _ {3}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {3}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {3}) ^ {2}} + \\\\ \\sqrt {(x - x _ {4}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {4}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {4}) ^ {2}}; \\quad (3) \\\\ \\text {对于} K A _ {4}: \\end{array}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"c06f06ca-9bd1-44b2-9ef6-4ae42ce1404e","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-10"},{"bbox":[246,104,475,143],"type":"interline_equation","angle":0,"index":12,"text":"$$\n\\begin{array}{l} V _ {\\mathrm{P}} \\Delta_ {4 1} = \\sqrt {(x - x _ {4}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {4}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {4}) ^ {2}} - \\\\ \\sqrt {(x - x _ {1}) ^ {2} + (y - y _ {1}) ^ {2} + (z - z _ {1}) ^ {2}}. \\end{array} \\tag {4}\n$$","color":{"line":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)","fill":"rgba(230, 122, 171, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"98d852eb-4c5b-4b06-9fdc-a8184f61cb84","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-11"},{"bbox":[288,146,435,248],"type":"image","angle":0,"index":13,"img_path":"/52be4912bb8b938ee24a242023df94f1ca6d15d7bd28029fac2594f647f4149f.jpg","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"img_ratio":0.296969696969697,"page_idx":1,"id":"6a474375-3209-40f7-a45e-1ed718d5b9d5","page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-12"},{"bbox":[291,250,429,262],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":14,"text":"图1 声发射位置确定的计算模型","id":"1b9c5564-4f63-4709-8c30-be72f6811a55","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[495,788],"block_position":"1-13"},{"bbox":[268,262,451,274],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":15,"text":"Fig．1 Calculating model of locating AE signals","id":"b5591ce6-d1a3-4a9b-b5